"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkcasdoor_website=globalThis.webpackChunkcasdoor_website||[]).push([[3532],{20900(a){a.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape","metadata":{"permalink":"/pt/blog/casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape","editUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor-website/edit/master/i18n/pt/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-02-22-casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape.mdx","source":"@site/i18n/pt/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-02-22-casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape.mdx","title":"Casdoor Joins CNCF Cloud Native Landscape","description":"On February 22, 2026, Casdoor joined the CNCF Cloud Native Landscape, under the Security & Compliance category in Provisioning. The Landscape brings together widely used cloud-native projects and products; inclusion helps users and enterprises discover and evaluate solutions for building cloud-native systems.","date":"2026-02-22T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"Casdoor","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/casdoor"},{"inline":true,"label":"CNCF","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/cncf"},{"inline":true,"label":"Cloud Native","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/cloud-native"},{"inline":true,"label":"Landscape","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/landscape"},{"inline":true,"label":"IAM","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/iam"},{"inline":true,"label":"SSO","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/sso"},{"inline":true,"label":"Seguran\xe7a","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/seguranca"}],"readingTime":1.95,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Casdoor Maintainer","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/hsluoyz","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape","title":"Casdoor Joins CNCF Cloud Native Landscape","authors":["hsluoyz"],"tags":["Casdoor","CNCF","Cloud Native","Landscape","IAM","SSO","Seguran\xe7a"],"date":"2026-02-22T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"Melhorando a Seguran\xe7a do Aplicativo e a Experi\xeancia do Usu\xe1rio com o SSO de Autentica\xe7\xe3o Facial do Casdoor","permalink":"/pt/blog/face-authentication-casdoor-sso"}},"content":"On February 22, 2026, **Casdoor** joined the [CNCF Cloud Native Landscape](https://landscape.cncf.io/), under the **Security & Compliance** category in Provisioning. The Landscape brings together widely used cloud-native projects and products; inclusion helps users and enterprises discover and evaluate solutions for building cloud-native systems.\\n\\n[https://landscape.cncf.io/?item=provisioning--security-compliance--casdoor](https://landscape.cncf.io/?item=provisioning--security-compliance--casdoor)\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n<img src=\\"/img/blog/cncf-landscape-casdoor.png\\" alt=\\"Casdoor on CNCF Landscape - Security and Compliance section\\" style={{maxWidth: \'100%\', height: \'auto\', border: \'1px solid #eee\', borderRadius: \'8px\'}} />\\n\\n_Casdoor on the CNCF Cloud Native Landscape (Security & Compliance)_\\n\\n## Sobre o Casdoor\\n\\n<div style={{display: \'flex\', alignItems: \'center\', gap: \'1rem\', flexWrap: \'wrap\', marginBottom: \'1rem\'}}>\\n\\n<img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/casdoor-logo_1185x256.png\\" alt=\\"Casdoor\\" style={{height: \'80px\', width: \'auto\'}} />\\n\\n</div>\\n\\nCasdoor is an open-source, UI-first Identity and Access Management (IAM) / Single Sign-On (SSO) platform with a web UI. It supports OAuth 2.0, OIDC, SAML, and CAS, as well as many social logins (Google, GitHub, WeChat, etc.), and helps you build user management and SSO in a few steps. Casdoor is developed by [Casbin](https://casbin.org) in Golang and React. It uses a front-end/back-end separation architecture, supports high concurrency, and is actively maintained by the community. The project has received over 13k GitHub stars.\\n\\n## About CNCF and the Cloud Native Landscape\\n\\n<div style={{display: \'flex\', alignItems: \'center\', gap: \'1.5rem\', flexWrap: \'wrap\', marginBottom: \'1rem\'}}>\\n\\n<img src=\\"https://www.cncf.io/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/cncf-main-site-logo.svg\\" alt=\\"CNCF - Cloud Native Computing Foundation\\" style={{height: \'80px\', width: \'auto\'}} />\\n<img src=\\"https://landscape.cncf.io/images/logo_header.svg\\" alt=\\"CNCF Cloud Native Landscape\\" style={{height: \'80px\', width: \'auto\'}} />\\n\\n</div>\\n\\nThe **Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF)** is a Linux Foundation project that promotes cloud-native technologies. Its vision is to make cloud native ubiquitous. CNCF maintains the **Cloud Native Landscape** ([https://landscape.cncf.io](https://landscape.cncf.io)), which classifies and tracks projects and products in the cloud-native ecosystem and serves as a reference map for developers and enterprises.\\n\\n## Looking ahead\\n\\nJoining the CNCF Landscape reflects progress in Casdoor\u2019s maturity and community. We will keep improving Casdoor and its integration with cloud-native workflows, and we welcome more users and contributors to join the community.\\n\\nLinks relacionados:\\n\\n- [Casdoor](https://casdoor.org) \xb7 [GitHub](https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor) \xb7 [Documentation](https://casdoor.org/docs) \xb7 [CNCF Landscape \u2013 Casdoor](https://landscape.cncf.io/?selected=casdoor)"},{"id":"face-authentication-casdoor-sso","metadata":{"permalink":"/pt/blog/face-authentication-casdoor-sso","editUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor-website/edit/master/i18n/pt/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2023-12-12-face-authentication-casdoor-sso.mdx","source":"@site/i18n/pt/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2023-12-12-face-authentication-casdoor-sso.mdx","title":"Melhorando a Seguran\xe7a do Aplicativo e a Experi\xeancia do Usu\xe1rio com o SSO de Autentica\xe7\xe3o Facial do Casdoor","description":"Em uma era onde a gest\xe3o de identidade digital \xe9 crucial, solu\xe7\xf5es de Single Sign-On (SSO) como o Casdoor est\xe3o revolucionando a maneira como os usu\xe1rios interagem com m\xfaltiplos aplicativos. O SSO do Casdoor simplifica o processo de login permitindo que os usu\xe1rios se autentiquem apenas uma vez para acessar m\xfaltiplos servi\xe7os. Isso n\xe3o apenas aumenta a conveni\xeancia do usu\xe1rio, mas tamb\xe9m impulsiona o engajamento e a satisfa\xe7\xe3o.","date":"2023-12-12T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"Casdoor","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/casdoor"},{"inline":true,"label":"SSO","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/sso"},{"inline":true,"label":"Single-Sign-On","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/single-sign-on"},{"inline":true,"label":"Face Recogniztion","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/face-recogniztion"},{"inline":true,"label":"FaceID","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/face-id"},{"inline":true,"label":"Face","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/face"},{"inline":true,"label":"Aprendizado de M\xe1quina","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/aprendizado-de-maquina"}],"readingTime":1.94,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"James Lawson","title":"Gerente de Produto","url":"https://casdoor.org","imageURL":"https://cdn.casbin.com/casdoor/static/admin.png","key":"James Lawson","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"face-authentication-casdoor-sso","title":"Melhorando a Seguran\xe7a do Aplicativo e a Experi\xeancia do Usu\xe1rio com o SSO de Autentica\xe7\xe3o Facial do Casdoor","authors":["James Lawson"],"tags":["Casdoor","SSO","Single-Sign-On","Face Recogniztion","FaceID","Face","Aprendizado de M\xe1quina"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Casdoor Joins CNCF Cloud Native Landscape","permalink":"/pt/blog/casdoor-joins-cncf-landscape"},"nextItem":{"title":"Bem-vindo","permalink":"/pt/blog/bem-vindo"}},"content":"Em uma era onde a gest\xe3o de identidade digital \xe9 crucial, solu\xe7\xf5es de Single Sign-On (SSO) como o Casdoor est\xe3o revolucionando a maneira como os usu\xe1rios interagem com m\xfaltiplos aplicativos. O SSO do Casdoor simplifica o processo de login permitindo que os usu\xe1rios se autentiquem apenas uma vez para acessar m\xfaltiplos servi\xe7os. Isso n\xe3o apenas aumenta a conveni\xeancia do usu\xe1rio, mas tamb\xe9m impulsiona o engajamento e a satisfa\xe7\xe3o.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nPara as empresas, o SSO do Casdoor racionaliza a gest\xe3o de credenciais dos usu\xe1rios, melhorando a seguran\xe7a e simplificando a integra\xe7\xe3o de novos usu\xe1rios. Ele contraria o risco associado a senhas fracas ou recicladas centralizando a gest\xe3o de usu\xe1rios.\\n\\nNo entanto, diante das crescentes amea\xe7as online, integrar medidas de seguran\xe7a robustas em sistemas SSO como o Casdoor \xe9 vital. \xc9 aqui que a tecnologia de autentica\xe7\xe3o facial entra em jogo, adicionando uma camada extra de prote\xe7\xe3o enquanto mant\xe9m intera\xe7\xf5es amig\xe1veis com o usu\xe1rio.\\n\\nA autentica\xe7\xe3o facial emprega caracter\xedsticas faciais \xfanicas para confirmar as identidades dos usu\xe1rios. Ela compara imagens ao vivo com modelos faciais armazenados, oferecendo uma maneira segura e simples de autenticar usu\xe1rios. Este m\xe9todo possui alta precis\xe3o, mesmo sob condi\xe7\xf5es variadas, e \xe9 amplamente adotado em dispositivos modernos do consumidor.\\n\\nIntegrar a autentica\xe7\xe3o facial no sistema SSO do Casdoor promete uma experi\xeancia de usu\xe1rio segura, eficiente e cont\xednua. Para garantir um desempenho \xf3timo, \xe9 crucial focar em:\\n\\n1. _Medidas Anti-Spoofing_: Implementar detec\xe7\xe3o de vivacidade, como rastreamento de movimentos dos olhos ou gestos aleat\xf3rios, \xe9 essencial para contrariar tentativas de spoofing e manter a integridade do sistema.\\n\\n2. _Atualiza\xe7\xf5es Regulares para Melhorar a Precis\xe3o_: Manter a tecnologia de autentica\xe7\xe3o facial atualizada com os \xfaltimos avan\xe7os em IA e biometria garante precis\xe3o e melhora a experi\xeancia do usu\xe1rio. \xc9 vital usar conjuntos de dados diversos para o treinamento de algoritmos para prevenir vieses.\\n\\n3. _Equilibrando Seguran\xe7a e Conveni\xeancia_: Os melhores sistemas encontram um equil\xedbrio perfeito entre medidas de seguran\xe7a rigorosas e a conveni\xeancia do usu\xe1rio. Essa abordagem incentiva a ado\xe7\xe3o do usu\xe1rio garantindo um processo de autentica\xe7\xe3o direto sem comprometer a seguran\xe7a.\\n\\nEm conclus\xe3o, integrando a autentica\xe7\xe3o facial com o SSO do Casdoor, as empresas podem oferecer uma experi\xeancia de login segura, eficiente e amig\xe1vel ao usu\xe1rio. Isso n\xe3o apenas fortalece a seguran\xe7a, mas tamb\xe9m est\xe1 alinhado com as expectativas modernas dos usu\xe1rios no mundo digital."},{"id":"bem-vindo","metadata":{"permalink":"/pt/blog/bem-vindo","editUrl":"https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor-website/edit/master/i18n/pt/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2021-08-24-welcome.mdx","source":"@site/i18n/pt/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2021-08-24-welcome.mdx","title":"Bem-vindo","description":"Bem-vindo ao site oficial do Casdoor!\ud83d\udc4b","date":"2021-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"Casdoor","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/casdoor"},{"inline":true,"label":"SSO","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/sso"},{"inline":true,"label":"Autentica\xe7\xe3o","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/autenticacao"},{"inline":true,"label":"OAuth2.0","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/o-auth-2-0"},{"inline":true,"label":"Casbin","permalink":"/pt/blog/tags/casbin"}],"readingTime":1.5,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"ErikQQY","title":"Membro do Casbin","url":"https://github.com/ErikQQY","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52615090?s=120&v=4","key":"ErikQQY","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"bem-vindo","title":"Bem-vindo","authors":["ErikQQY"],"tags":["Casdoor","SSO","Autentica\xe7\xe3o","OAuth2.0","Casbin"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Melhorando a Seguran\xe7a do Aplicativo e a Experi\xeancia do Usu\xe1rio com o SSO de Autentica\xe7\xe3o Facial do Casdoor","permalink":"/pt/blog/face-authentication-casdoor-sso"}},"content":"Bem-vindo ao site oficial do Casdoor!\ud83d\udc4b\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## O que \xe9 o Casdoor?\\n\\nCasdoor is a UI-first [Identity Access Management (IAM)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Identity_management) / [Single-Sign-On (SSO)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Single_sign-on) platform based on OAuth 2.0, OIDC, SAML and CAS.\\n\\nCasdoor is developed by [Casbin](https://casbin.org) using Golang and React.\\n\\nO Casdoor visa fornecer uma plataforma de autentica\xe7\xe3o poderosa para lidar com o gerenciamento de usu\xe1rios.\\n\\n## Por que usar o Casdoor?\\n\\n- \u26a1\ufe0f Recurso poderoso e configura\xe7\xe3o simples. With support for  <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_google.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_github.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_facebook.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_twitter.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_linkedin.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_weibo.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_wechat.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_qq.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_dingtalk.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img>   <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_gitee.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img>  <img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_wecom.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img><img src=\\"https://cdn.casbin.org/img/social_gitlab.png\\" width=\\"30\\"></img> sign in and traditional username/password sign in, Casdoor helps you implement your users management system just in a few steps.\\n\\n- \ud83d\udca5 Arquitetura de separa\xe7\xe3o front-end back-end. O Casdoor fornece uma UI manobr\xe1vel e suporta alta concorr\xeancia.\\n\\n- \ud83e\udd42 Comunidade open source ativa. O Casdoor \xe9 open source e mantido ativamente.\\n\\n- \ud83c\udf10 Suporte a m\xfaltiplos idiomas. O Casdoor suporta v\xe1rios idiomas, incluindo chin\xeas, ingl\xeas, franc\xeas e muitos outros.\\n\\n## Como usar o Casdoor?\\n\\nYou can follow the detailed document to learn about [Casdoor API](https://door.casdoor.com/swagger/) and [setup your own Casdoor](/docs/basic/server-installation). Or use the [Casdoor SDKs](/docs/how-to-connect/sdk) to implement your own application."}]}}')}}]);